{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02380",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 7.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Doctor, this one's ready for you. Everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.28,
      "end_seconds": 11.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Thank you. Right, hello, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.56,
      "end_seconds": 18.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Yeah, it's tingling in the foot. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 19.62,
      "end_seconds": 35.97,
      "duration_seconds": 16.35,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Weight 74 kilos, pressure 115 over 71, respiratory rate 15, height 169 centimetres, temp 37.0 degrees, pulse 80, BMI works out to 25.9, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.32,
      "end_seconds": 41.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Okay, noted. How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.06,
      "end_seconds": 45.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I've had it for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.79,
      "end_seconds": 55.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.19,
      "end_seconds": 60.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I'd say mild. Honestly, every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.97,
      "end_seconds": 64.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.19,
      "end_seconds": 77.27,
      "duration_seconds": 11.08,
      "text": "Pain out of proportion goes along with it, most of the time. I've also had severe pain in the lower leg after a fracture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.44,
      "end_seconds": 89.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Any chest pain, fever or wound infection?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.59,
      "end_seconds": 92.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.01,
      "end_seconds": 96.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.86,
      "end_seconds": 102.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.03,
      "end_seconds": 108.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "So, what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.19,
      "end_seconds": 111.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.15,
      "end_seconds": 129.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Right, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.43,
      "end_seconds": 141.52,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.2,
      "end_seconds": 146.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.97,
      "end_seconds": 156.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis. My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.3,
      "end_seconds": 160.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.8,
      "end_seconds": 168.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "I have high cholesterol, for about a year. Acid reflux, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.81,
      "end_seconds": 170.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.67,
      "end_seconds": 176.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.01,
      "end_seconds": 181.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.0,
      "end_seconds": 192.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.55,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I work in accounts at a hospital. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.83,
      "end_seconds": 195.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.67,
      "end_seconds": 201.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "It's Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.45,
      "end_seconds": 207.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.47,
      "end_seconds": 219.69,
      "duration_seconds": 11.22,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Strong painkillers, not working. Before this I was on rosuvastatin; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.99,
      "end_seconds": 225.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.07,
      "end_seconds": 229.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.84,
      "end_seconds": 246.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "The calf is tense and shiny, and stretching the toes makes the pain much worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.88,
      "end_seconds": 252.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.29,
      "end_seconds": 277.26,
      "duration_seconds": 14.97,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like possible compartment syndrome needing urgent surgery. It could also be a deep vein thrombosis, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.32,
      "end_seconds": 282.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.77,
      "end_seconds": 310.13,
      "duration_seconds": 27.36,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible compartment syndrome needing urgent surgery, and we'll know more once the measuring the pressure in the leg is back. I'd like to arrange measuring the pressure in the leg for possible compartment syndrome. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.87,
      "end_seconds": 313.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.21,
      "end_seconds": 317.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.96,
      "end_seconds": 323.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.51,
      "end_seconds": 326.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}